# ============================================================================
# Files that must not reach the Vercel deployment.
# ============================================================================

# Local preview server. With this at the repo root Vercel detects a Node
# entrypoint and serves the WHOLE site through it as a serverless function.
# Only index.html gets bundled into that lambda, so every stylesheet and
# script 404s and the site renders blank. Ignoring it restores plain static
# hosting from the repo root. `node server.js` still works locally.
server.js

# Build inputs and the full generated dataset. groups.ndjson carries the part
# numbers and fitment lists that the subscription pays for, so these must not
# be downloadable from the site. They are only needed locally by
# scripts/import-firestore.js.
# assets/search-index.json is deliberately NOT here: it holds the free
# catalogue (model names, brands, years) and no paid fields.
data/
scripts/

# Backend configuration — shipped with the Firebase CLI, not with the site.
firebase.json
firestore.rules
firestore.indexes.json

# Tooling
.claude/
README.md
